#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/win-composer.page:341
msgid ""
"<guiseq> <gui>Options</gui> <gui>Request Disposition Notification</gui> "
"</guiseq> -- If checked <app>Balsa</app> will include the <code>Disposition-"
